# Invoice approval workflow — technical specification

The workflow tool routes supplier invoices for approval using fixed rules written by the finance team:
- invoices under EUR 1,000 from approved suppliers are approved automatically;
- invoices from new suppliers go to the procurement lead;
- amounts over EUR 50,000 need CFO sign-off.

The rules are stored in a configuration table and edited manually. The tool does not learn from data, use statistical models or make predictions; it only executes the rules as written.
